ity Garden Get Involved Contact Us Indigenous Initiatives An apology and our commitment to Indigenous Peoples Indigenous Resource Hub/L’nuey Etl-Mawo’tumk L’nu Advisory Circle Faculty Resources People and Culture Equity, Diversity, Inclusion & Accessibility (EDIA) Faculty and Staff EDI MSVU Accessibility Plan EDIA Hub Strategic Enrolment Management (SEM) Plan MSVU Mascot Why inclusion and diversity is important to the Mount Equity, diversity and inclusion means acknowledging and embracing each individual’s uniqueness, which includes race, ethnicity, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity and gender expression, socio-economic status, age, religious beliefs, political beliefs, and other characteristics and ideologies. It also means celebrating, in a safe environment, the rich dimensions of diversity contained within each individual. Cultivating diversity in the workplace develops stronger relationships, fostered by trust, respect and open dialogue. Mount Saint Vincent University strives to be welcoming and understanding, and is committed to fostering equity, diversity, and inclusion. MSVU encourages you to take steps to understanding the diverse cultures, ethnicities and beliefs within MSVU and our neighbouring communities. Employment Equity Policy MSVU has an Employment Equity Committee which acts as an advisory body in the development, implementation and monitoring of the employment equity plan and as a forum in which employment equity issues can be discussed. The Committee is made up of representatives from our employee groups who are passionate about creating a community of diversity at MSVU. Further information for faculty and staff interested in learning more about the Committee’s initiatives can be found on the Intranet under Human Resources (log-in required) . For more information on inclusion and employment equity at MSVU, please contact Tammy Mercer . Home 166 Bedford Highway , Halifax, Nova Scotia, B3M 2J6 MSVU is located on unceded ancestral Mi’kmaq territory. Social Media » Connect with MSVU Facebook X Instagram YouTube Social Media myMount/email Moodle Intranet WebAdvisor Media Centre Parking & Security Campus Map © 2026 MSVU Disclaimer Website Feedback Sitemap"
