s Copyright & Fair Dealing About the Library Welcome Hours Location Strategic Plan Policies / Procedures LIBR 2100: Library Research Special Collections MacDonald Collection Lesbian Pulp Fiction Collection Call Number Arrangement Library Awards University Archives About Us Thesis Deposit Our Collections Policies Related Links Search Collections Microcredentials Case Management Fundamentals Ready to Lead Community Engagement: Meaning and Methods Frequently Asked Questions and Support for Current Microcredential Registrants Experts in the Classroom and the Field One of the big reasons why the Mount’s Business Administration and Tourism and Hospitality Management programs are so successful in educating career-ready graduates is because many of our faculty actually work in the industry. Of course, they also have the academic credentials to impart their substantial knowledge of the industry. You get the best of both the academic world and the practical hands-on experience of professors who have first-hand knowledge of the industry in action. Meet our experts in the classroom and the field. We are here to help. Accounting and Finance Rhonda Bursey , Coordinator Germaine Chan Arron Fraser Normand Gendron Elsie Henderson Jeff McKinnon Management Nicholous Deal , Coordinator Gabrielle Durepos Sandi Findlay-Thompson Ned Kelleher Q.C. Scott MacMillan Peter Mombourquette Jeff Young Tianyuan Yu Marketing Karen Blotnicky , Coordinator Sheri Landry Maria Matthews, Department Chair Danny Wadden Nonprofit Leadership Nicholous Deal Normand Gendron Scott MacMillan Tourism and Hospitality Management Candace Blayney Paulette Cormier-MacBurnie Jennifer Guy , Coordinator Shuyue Huang Maria Matthews , Department Chair Deanna Struthers Go back to the Tourism and Hospitality Management pages. Department Support Colleen Blacker Communications and Programs Administrative Assistant office hours: 8:15am to 4:15pm Available via email Monday and Tuesday Available in office Wednesday to Friday Summer office hours: June 1 to August 31 – 8:15am to 3:45pm Miriam Gallant Administrative Assistant office hours: 9:30am to 5:30pm Available via email Thursday and Friday Available in office Monday to Wednesday Summer office hours: June 1 to August 31 – 9:15am to 4:45pm Professor Emerita / Emeritus Dr. Margaret Bateman Ellison Dr. Mallika Das Wendy Doyle Dr. Robert Farmer In memoriam Dr. Mohammad Siddiquee Mailing address Department of Business Administration and Tourism and Hospitality Management We are located in the Margaret Norrie McCain Centre for Teaching, Learning and Research on the 4th floor. Mailing address: Mount Saint Vincent University Department of Business Administration and Tourism and Hospitality Management 51 Lumpkin Drive Halifax, NS, B3M 2J6 Fax 902 445 2582 Get in touch with us today and get the information you need to begin your journey! Meet Dr. Maria Matthews | Chair of the Department of Business and Tourism Follow us! Facebook Instagram YouTube flickr TikTok LinkedIn Home 166 Bedford Highway , Halifax, Nova Scotia, B3M 2J6 MSVU is located on unceded ancestral Mi’kmaq territory. Social Media » Connect with MSVU Facebook X Instagram YouTube Social Media myMount/email Moodle Intranet WebAdvisor Media Centre Parking & Security Campus Map © 2026 MSVU Disclaimer Website Feedback Sitemap"
