    "https://www.careerbeacon.com/en/employer-showcase/msvu": {
      "title": "Mount Saint Vincent University",
      "description": "Mount Saint Vincent University's Employer Showcase | CareerBeacon Home Search Jobs Search Employers Salary Tools Income Tax Calculator Salary Converter Minimum Hourly Wage Cost of Living Calculator Browse Places Salary Tools Income Tax Calculator Salary Converter Minimum Hourly Wage Cost of Living Calculator Browse Places Blog Get Hired For Employers Post a Job Use Employer Services to easily post your job. Candidate Manager ATS Get a full suite of tools for all your hiring needs. Diversity and Inclusion Outreach One-Stop Employment equity solutions For Employers Post a Job Candidate Manager ATS Diversity and Inclusion Outreach Log In Log In FR Français Feedback Add to Home Screen Mount Saint Vincent University About Mount Saint Vincent University A leader in online and experiential learning, Mount Saint Vincent University takes a personalized approach to education to nurture socially responsible global citizens. With equity, diversity, inclusion and accessibility at the fore, MSVU has been challenging the status quo since its founding 150 years ago (1873) and today prioritizes access and impact for all underserved groups. MSVU has been nationally recognized for having one of the lowest student-to-professor ratios across its programs in Arts, Science, Education and Professional Studies; for providing students early access to valuable research opportunities; for its legacy in the advancement of women; and for facilitating critical advancements in food security, healthy aging, literacy, nutrition, childhood development and more. MSVU is located in Mi’kma’ki, the unceded and ancestral territory of the Mi’kmaq People. www.msvu.ca Photo Gallery Current Job Openings 5 \n\t\t\t\tJobs Found Showing Page 1 of 1 View All Jobs Carpenter Mount Saint Vincent University Halifax, NS 51 days ago SENIOR FINANCIAL ANALYST Mount Saint Vincent University Halifax, NS 28 days ago CUSTODIAN Mount Saint Vincent University Halifax, NS 15 days ago DIRECTOR, TEACHING AND LEARNING Mount Saint Vincent University Halifax, NS 14 days ago INTERIM COMMUICATIONS COORDINATOR AND OFFICE ADMINISTRATOR Mount Saint Vincent University Halifax, NS Yesterday Share Contact Us Mount Saint Vincent University Halifax,  NS,  Canada All Establishments Geocodes http://www.msvu.ca/careers Please confirm you wish to get emails for this search ? No Yes Social media Add the links to the social media platforms you'd like your candidates to see. Facebook Twitter TikTok Linkedin Instagram Youtube + Back Save Please crop your image for a thumbnail Title Close Upload For Jobseekers Get Hired Search Jobs Browse Jobs Browse Employers Browse Places Income Tax Calculator Salary Converter Cost of Living Calculator Minimum Hourly Wage 2026 Career Advice FOR EMPLOYERS Post a Job Candidate Manager ATS Diversity and Inclusion Outreach Recruiting Advice Contact Sales About Us Who We Are Blog Contact Us Terms of Service Privacy Policy Latest Updates Announcement English Français © 2026  CareerBeacon.  All rights reserved. Powered by Alongside For Jobseekers Get Hired Search Jobs Browse Jobs Browse Employers Browse Places Income Tax Calculator Salary Converter Cost of Living Calculator Minimum Hourly Wage 2026 Career Advice FOR EMPLOYERS Post a Job Candidate Manager ATS Diversity and Inclusion Outreach Recruiting Advice Contact Sales About Us Who We Are Blog Contact Us Terms of Service Privacy Policy LANGUAGE English Français Latest Updates Announcement © 2026 CareerBeacon. All rights reserved. Powered by Alongside"
